@startuml
title Flow 4 - Share creation and guest access

actor "Music librarian" as Lib
participant "SAM UI" as UI
participant "SAM Server" as Server
actor "Guest" as Guest

Lib -> UI: Shares -> New share\n(resource + expiry)
UI -> Server: POST /api/shares
Server -> Server: create token,\ncreator = caller
Server --> UI: ShareResponse
UI --> Lib: public URL shown

Lib -> Guest: copies link,\nsends via WhatsApp

Guest -> Server: GET /public/share/{token}
Server -> Server: validate: not expired/revoked
Server --> Guest: render resource
Server -> Server: log event_log\n(shareTokenId set,\nuserId/username null)
@enduml